<title>POLAND: Espebepe creditors accept debt deal.</title>
<headline>Espebepe creditors accept debt deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Creditors of Polish construction firm Espebepe SA accepted the company's version of a debt-write -off deal envisaging an 80-percent write-off, the company's president said on Friday.</p>
</text>
